   "html": "<div class='callout'><p><b>专业问题：</b>均匀配注忽略层间连通与含水差异。</p><p><b>输入资料：</b>注采连通矩阵、层段吸水能力和注水预算。</p><p><b>服务目标：</b>在同一水量预算下比较分层分配方案。</p></div><svg viewBox='0 0 720 250' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='分层注水层间矛盾示意'><text x='20' y='18' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#202b38'>分层注水：水从哪级水嘴进哪一层，决定油井见水的快慢</text><line x1='108' y1='8' x2='108' y2='30' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='2' marker-end='url(#arP3a)'/><text transform=\"translate(80 20)\" x='116' y='14' font-size='9' fill='#41699b'>注入水 300 m³/d</text><rect x='96' y='36' width='24' height='180' rx='4' fill='#e9eef5' stroke='#41699b'/><text transform=\"translate(-60 15)\" x='108' y='28' font-size='10' font-weight='600' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle'>注水井</text><rect x='96' y='92' width='24' height='4' fill='#52627a'/><rect x='96' y='152' width='24' height='4' fill='#52627a'/><rect x='150' y='36' width='260' height='56' fill='#f6ebe1' stroke='#d47a3a' stroke-opacity='.6'/><rect x='150' y='96' width='260' height='56' fill='#e7f0fb' stroke='#2875c7' stroke-opacity='.6'/><rect x='150' y='156' width='260' height='56' fill='#e9eef5' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.6'/><text x='280' y='58' font-size='10' font-weight='600' fill='#d47a3a' text-anchor='middle'>高渗层（K×3.6）</text><text x='280' y='74' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b' text-anchor='middle'>吸水 55% · 注多必窜</text><text x='280' y='118' font-size='10' font-weight='600' fill='#2875c7' text-anchor='middle'>中渗层（K×1.8）</text><text x='280' y='134' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b' text-anchor='middle'>吸水 30%</text><text x='280' y='178' font-size='10' font-weight='600' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle'>低渗层（K×1.0）</text><text x='280' y='194' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b' text-anchor='middle'>吸水 15% · 长期欠注</text><line x1='120' y1='64' x2='144' y2='64' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='5' marker-end='url(#arP3a)'/><line x1='120' y1='124' x2='144' y2='124' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='3' marker-end='url(#arP3a)'/><line x1='120' y1='184' x2='144' y2='184' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#arP3a)'/><rect x='560' y='36' width='24' height='180' rx='4' fill='#f7e9e6' stroke='#b05a51'/><text x='572' y='28' font-size='10' font-weight='600' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>对应油井</text><line x1='410' y1='64' x2='554' y2='64' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='5' marker-end='url(#arP3b)'/><text x='484' y='52' font-size='9.5' font-weight='600' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>水窜：含水飙升</text><line x1='410' y1='124' x2='554' y2='124' stroke='#2875c7' stroke-width='3' marker-end='url(#arP3c)'/><text x='484' y='112' font-size='9.5' fill='#2875c7' text-anchor='middle'>有效驱油</text><line x1='410' y1='184' x2='554' y2='184' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-dasharray='4 3' marker-end='url(#arP3d)'/><text x='484' y='172' font-size='9.5' fill='#64748b' text-anchor='middle'>欠注：能量不足</text><text x='360' y='236' font-size='9.5' fill='#52627a' text-anchor='middle'>均匀配注 = 每层各 100 m³/d：高渗层吃不完还窜得快，低渗层一直喝不饱</text><defs><marker id='arP3a' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' refX='6' refY='3.5' orient='auto' markerUnits='userSpaceOnUse'><path d='M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7 Z' fill='#41699b'/></marker><marker id='arP3b' markerWidth='8' markerHeight='8' refX='7' refY='4' orient='auto' markerUnits='userSpaceOnUse'><path d='M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 Z' fill='#b05a51'/></marker><marker id='arP3c' markerWidth='8' markerHeight='8' refX='7' refY='4' orient='auto' markerUnits='userSpaceOnUse'><path d='M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 Z' fill='#2875c7'/></marker><marker id='arP3d' markerWidth='8' markerHeight='8' refX='7' refY='4' orient='auto' markerUnits='userSpaceOnUse'><path d='M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 Z' fill='#9ba3a9'/></marker></defs></svg><div class='figcap'><b>专业原理示意</b><span>用于解释业务概念和空间、参数关系；图中数字与对照为教学示意，不是现场成果。</span></div>"
